    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "Welcome Survivor! <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2906500/extras/d0f996810a0bc4d986f0fe3aa9915064.poster.avif?t=1712733343\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2906500/extras/d0f996810a0bc4d986f0fe3aa9915064.webm?t=1712733343\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2906500/extras/d0f996810a0bc4d986f0fe3aa9915064.mp4?t=1712733343\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>The Thing That Happened is an Openworld Third Person - Action Adventure Survial game.<br>You can use multiple weapons, attachments, close combat skills trees and crafting to break through your enemies.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2906500/extras/bec0168794db53d059c8f950752b2c66.poster.avif?t=1712733343\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2906500/extras/bec0168794db53d059c8f950752b2c66.webm?t=1712733343\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2906500/extras/bec0168794db53d059c8f950752b2c66.mp4?t=1712733343\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>In a post-apocalyptic world,  Torque who arrived in the city of Jericho. The city was in ruins, with remnants of an old civilization scattered everywhere. Torque had been traveling for days, scavenging for food and supplies to survive in this harsh new world.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2906500/extras/7d12aa75290d8ded221b04f005cbc567.poster.avif?t=1712733343\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2906500/extras/7d12aa75290d8ded221b04f005cbc567.webm?t=1712733343\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2906500/extras/7d12aa75290d8ded221b04f005cbc567.mp4?t=1712733343\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>As Torque entered Jericho, he was met with a desolate landscape - crumbling buildings, overgrown vegetation, and a sense of eerie silence. The once bustling city was now a ghost town, haunted by the memories of its former glory.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2906500/extras/0b7645d9a7108a306489b5f1a28e8a6b.poster.avif?t=1712733343\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2906500/extras/0b7645d9a7108a306489b5f1a28e8a6b.webm?t=1712733343\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2906500/extras/0b7645d9a7108a306489b5f1a28e8a6b.mp4?t=1712733343\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Facing challenges such as scarce resources, hostile gangs, and the constant threat of danger, Torque and his newfound companions worked tirelessly to fortify their makeshift home. They repurposed old buildings, set up defenses, and established a system for gathering supplies and maintaining security.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2906500/extras/7ffa1324d7ee17e065f7709e7d10596a.poster.avif?t=1712733343\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2906500/extras/7ffa1324d7ee17e065f7709e7d10596a.webm?t=1712733343\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2906500/extras/7ffa1324d7ee17e065f7709e7d10596a.mp4?t=1712733343\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Though the world around them remained harsh and unforgiving, the spirit of resilience and community in Jericho served as a beacon of hope in the face of adversity. Torque's journey in the post-apocalyptic city of Jericho was a testament to the human capacity for survival, adaptation, and the enduring will to rebuild even in the bleakest of circumstances.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2906500/extras/55089f4af92dcb4ee41f35851418ca6e.poster.avif?t=1712733343\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2906500/extras/55089f4af92dcb4ee41f35851418ca6e.webm?t=1712733343\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2906500/extras/55089f4af92dcb4ee41f35851418ca6e.mp4?t=1712733343\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br>Achived with Unreal Engine 5.2<br><br>I'm a solo developer , please keep that in mind.<br>I used UE marketplace / Sketsfab assets, just like most of the indie developers and many big title's does.<br>I released the full potential of the game engine, i used nanite, and lumen technology for the best results.<br><br>Good luck Torque!",
    "about_the_game": "Welcome Survivor! <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2906500/extras/d0f996810a0bc4d986f0fe3aa9915064.poster.avif?t=1712733343\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2906500/extras/d0f996810a0bc4d986f0fe3aa9915064.webm?t=1712733343\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2906500/extras/d0f996810a0bc4d986f0fe3aa9915064.mp4?t=1712733343\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>The Thing That Happened is an Openworld Third Person - Action Adventure Survial game.<br>You can use multiple weapons, attachments, close combat skills trees and crafting to break through your enemies.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2906500/extras/bec0168794db53d059c8f950752b2c66.poster.avif?t=1712733343\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2906500/extras/bec0168794db53d059c8f950752b2c66.webm?t=1712733343\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2906500/extras/bec0168794db53d059c8f950752b2c66.mp4?t=1712733343\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>In a post-apocalyptic world,  Torque who arrived in the city of Jericho. The city was in ruins, with remnants of an old civilization scattered everywhere. Torque had been traveling for days, scavenging for food and supplies to survive in this harsh new world.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2906500/extras/7d12aa75290d8ded221b04f005cbc567.poster.avif?t=